<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound interbank market quiet and liquid.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound interbank market quiet and liquid.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were quoted at 7 percent on Monday, compared to Sunday's range of 7-1/4 to 8-1/4 percent in a liquid private sector market, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were between 8 and 8-1/4 percent from 7-1/2 and 8-1/2 percent, they added.</p>
<p>Bankers said that public sector banks had kept their minimum lending rate steady at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1 ceh</p>
